# Rank 1223 / CVE-2018-14721: jackson-databind's BeanDeserializerFactory
# (src/main/java/com/fasterxml/jackson/databind/deser/BeanDeserializerFactory.java)
# guards polymorphic/default-typed deserialization with a hardcoded denylist,
# DEFAULT_NO_DESER_CLASS_NAMES, checked through the instance field it seeds
# once, _cfgIllegalClassNames, inside checkIllegalTypes (CWE-184: incomplete
# blacklist; the advisory's own class is CWE-918, because one of the gadget
# classes the fix blocks, org.apache.axis2.jaxws.spi.handler.HandlerResolverImpl,
# performs an outbound WSDL fetch on instantiation). Fix
# 87d29af25e82a249ea15858e2d4ecbf64091db44 appends four class names to that
# static initializer and touches nothing else. `git tag --contains` puts the
# commit first in 2.6.7.2, then 2.7.9.5, 2.8.11.3 and 2.9.7, and the advisory
# (GHSA-9mxf-g3x6-wv74; NVD "2.x before 2.9.7") names 2.9.7 as the first
# patched version, with 2.8.0-2.8.11.2 and 2.7.0-2.7.9.4 affected on the older
# streams.
#
# The weakness is the completeness of a set that lives inside the library, so
# the application's polymorphic read is correct code and no application-side
# pattern separates a vulnerable pin from a fixed one -- the report that
# belongs to this CVE is the dependency finding: a Maven pin of
# com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind below 2.9.7. The feed holds one
# threshold per artifact and the advisory's own range has the same boundary,
# so the older-stream micro-releases that also carry the fix (2.6.7.2,
# 2.7.9.5, 2.8.11.3) report too; that is the row's stated residual rather
# than a second threshold.

test "rank1223: a jackson-databind pin below the first denylist-completed release is a dependency finding"
  lang java
  file src/main/java/example/App.java
  code
  ```
  package example;

  import com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.ObjectMapper;

  public class App {
      public static class Payload {
          public int a;
      }

      public Payload read(String json) throws Exception {
          ObjectMapper mapper = new ObjectMapper();
          mapper.enableDefaultTyping();
          return mapper.readValue(json, Payload.class);
      }
  }
  ```
  file pom.xml
  code
  ```
  <project xmlns="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0">
    <modelVersion>4.0.0</modelVersion>
    <groupId>example</groupId>
    <artifactId>app</artifactId>
    <version>1.0.0</version>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency>
        <groupId>com.fasterxml.jackson.core</groupId>
        <artifactId>jackson-databind</artifactId>
        <version>2.9.6</version>
      </dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </project>
  ```
  expect VYQL-SCA-001
  expect_evidence VYQL-SCA-001 CVE-2018-14721
  expect VYQL-SCA-008
  expect VYQL-SCA-002

